prompts.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Project asset: production sprite atlas for the AKIRA desktop assistant.
Create ONE exact 3 columns by 3 rows sprite sheet, square 2048x2048 canvas, with 9 clearly distinct friendly expressions of the SAME male white Samoyed puppy. Images 1 and 2 are the user's real dog: match his white fluffy fur, upright triangular ears, small round black dot eyes and black button nose. Image 3 is the approved pixel-art mascot/style reference with bone AKIRA: preserve that endearing identity and soft face, but draw clean classic simple pixel art.
Layout is essential: 9 equal square cells, centers exactly at 1/6, 1/2, 5/6 of canvas width and height. Each cell contains exactly one COMPLETE seated dog, same size and front-facing body, all ears/tail/paws within the central 78% of its cell, generous transparent gutters. Same pale-white body, soft warm-gray outlines and very few subtle cream shadows in every cell. Tail curled beside him. Compact, round and fluffy, friendly masculine puppy, tiny dot eyes widely but naturally spaced, small muzzle. No collar, harness, ring, clothing, bone, badge, text, hearts, sparkles, props, grid lines or background. Actual transparent background, not a checkerboard.
Each face must visibly differ. Read order left to right then top to bottom:
1 calm attentive, small black dot eyes and tiny closed smile;
2 happy gentle small open smile, relaxed dot eyes;
3 delighted closed upward-curved eyes and soft open smile;
4 left-eye wink with tiny closed smile;
5 right-eye wink with tiny tongue;
6 curious eyes looking left and slightly raised left ear;
7 curious eyes looking right with small rounded o mouth;
8 bashful half-closed eyes with subtle pink cheeks and tiny smile;
9 content peaceful eyes closed and mouth closed.
NOT scary. No teeth, fangs, human teeth/lips, giant mouth, long nose, heavy eyebrows, creepy eyes, angry frown, horror, realistic fur, blur or 3D. Every expression has the same clean kawaii puppy anatomy as the mascot reference. Pixel edges crisp and carefully drawn. Do not blend neighboring cells. No text anywhere.
